{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>I am not able, I alone, etc.</b> Here he has finalized his will, for it is not as a complaint that he is merely protesting yet would agree to bear it — rather he revealed his mind and his will that he does not wish to bear it alone, and he gave the reason — not, heaven forbid, that he refuses to carry out the word of HaShem, but rather that he assessed that it is a burden too heavy for him and he cannot bear it:"], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:07:33.732841987Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}